From 2bb48edb33c693d5876cf0c8b9b021526d274fe1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yixue Wang <yixue.wang@outlook.com>
Date: Mon, 31 Aug 2026 14:52:38 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(image): allow application/json for /images/edits under
 pass-through (#2336)

Previously /images/edits always required multipart/form-data, rejecting
application/json requests even with channel pass-through enabled. Split
the edit path by Content-Type: JSON requests keep the raw body for
verbatim forwarding, multipart requests keep the existing rebuild path.
Pass-through now replays JSON edit bodies instead of excluding them.

- inbound: dispatch by Content-Type, add transformEditJSONRequest
- outbound: forward raw JSON body, patch model via sjson
- pass-through: allow JSON image-edit bodies, keep multipart excluded
